post.description:
Start generating a daily portfolio report.

Returns a Server-Sent Events stream. Each event is a JSON payload:
- {"type": "text", "content": "..."}
- {"type": "tool_start", "name": "...", "input": {...}}
- {"type": "tool_end", "name": "..."}
- {"type": "done"}
- {"type": "error", "message": "..."}
